WEBVTT

00:21.249 --> 00:28.193
I'm

00:28.213 --> 00:31.955
typing out the coordinates on the terminal

00:31.976 --> 00:32.576
screen

00:35.578 --> 00:39.700
The cleanest set of numbers that I've ever seen I

00:42.442 --> 00:46.344
know you're out there burning in the asteroid

00:46.464 --> 00:46.925
field

00:49.523 --> 00:53.126
I know you're pushing hard against the broken

00:53.306 --> 00:53.946
shield.

00:56.428 --> 00:59.910
But I'm standing in the center of the quiet and

00:59.970 --> 01:00.931
the clear.

01:03.573 --> 01:07.415
I'm sending out a signal just to let you know I'm

01:07.515 --> 01:08.096
here.

01:11.040 --> 01:14.083
The radar is sweeping, the sequence is locked.

01:14.583 --> 01:17.646
The data is streaming, the channel is docked.

01:18.187 --> 01:20.769
Across the dark vacuum, across the great

01:20.789 --> 01:24.113
divide, a burst of information from the other

01:24.253 --> 01:29.376
side. Telemetry! Pinching in the dots Shooting

01:29.576 --> 01:33.357
out a message like a digital spark Telemetry

01:33.978 --> 01:37.439
Reading out the lines Looking at the numbers and

01:37.479 --> 01:41.681
decoding the signs I won't let you pull me I won't

01:41.701 --> 01:47.043
let you drag me down But I'll send you the

01:47.083 --> 01:50.124
telemetry from my side of town

01:57.053 --> 02:01.396
I can see a friction burning up the atmosphere.

02:03.737 --> 02:07.039
You're running on the edge, you're running on

02:07.099 --> 02:07.919
the gear.

02:10.361 --> 02:14.203
But I am in the Goldilocks, the temperature is

02:14.323 --> 02:14.943
right.

02:17.445 --> 02:20.807
I'm just a glowing beacon in the middle of your

02:20.907 --> 02:21.187
night.

02:25.037 --> 02:28.759
Data, read the math, adjust your heavy spin

02:31.400 --> 02:35.123
But I am keeping the perimeter, you cannot enter

02:35.143 --> 02:35.183
in

02:38.867 --> 02:41.890
The radar is sweeping, the sequence is locked.

02:42.371 --> 02:45.394
The data is streaming, the channel is docked.

02:45.934 --> 02:48.497
Across the dark vacuum, across the great

02:48.517 --> 02:51.800
divide, a burst of information from the other

02:51.941 --> 02:57.026
side. Telemetry, pinging in the dark, shooting

02:57.226 --> 03:01.010
out a message like a digital spark. Telemetry,

03:01.570 --> 03:05.031
Reading up the lines, looking at the numbers and

03:05.051 --> 03:08.912
decoding the signs I won't let you pull me, I

03:08.992 --> 03:11.072
won't let you drag me down

03:13.312 --> 03:17.153
But I'll send you the telemetry from my side of

03:17.213 --> 03:17.553
town

03:48.682 --> 03:56.669
Signal out. Signal received. The distance is

03:56.769 --> 04:00.473
maintained. The sanctuary.

04:02.194 --> 04:09.184
The chief. Telemetry, pinging in the dark

04:09.304 --> 04:12.426
Shooting out a message like a digital spark

04:12.987 --> 04:17.290
Telemetry, reading up the lines Looking at the

04:17.350 --> 04:20.733
numbers and decoding the signs I won't let you

04:20.793 --> 04:27.038
pull me, I won't let you drag me down But I'll send

04:27.078 --> 04:30.501
you the telemetry from my side of town

04:33.745 --> 04:38.614
Signal out. End transmission.

04:40.698 --> 04:42.020
Telemetry free.

